#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/migration.md:21
msgid ""
"外部工程通过 `NEXUS_ASSEMBLY_FILE` 明确输入，链接 `Nexus::Platform`，由 `nexus_add_firmware()` 装入 "
"startup/system/linker/resource gate。应用只包含公共 Nexus 头和生成 `nexus_factory.h`／`nexus_bindings.h`，不读取 "
"private provider storage 或 SDK register 类型。SPI／I2C controller 和子设备 endpoint 分开获取，controller "
"factory 不得返回第一个子设备的别名。无效 ID 返回 NULL；factory 不初始化、不分配内存。"
msgstr ""
"External projects supply explicit `NEXUS_ASSEMBLY_FILE`, link `Nexus::Platform`, and use "
"`nexus_add_firmware()` for startup/system/linker/resource gates. Applications include only public "
"Nexus headers and generated `nexus_factory.h`/`nexus_bindings.h`; they do not inspect private "
"provider storage or SDK register types. SPI/I2C controllers and child-device endpoints are "
"obtained separately; a controller factory must not return an alias of the first child. Invalid IDs"
" return NULL. Factory lookup neither initializes nor allocates memory."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/migration.md:27
msgid ""
"维护的 assembly 已统一为 TOML schema 2。schema 1 JSON 读取仅供明确迁移与工具 派生输入，不与 TOML 维护同一份配置。冷启动仍显式执行 "
"`nx_platform_start()`， 停机执行 `nx_platform_stop()`；BUSY／QUARANTINED 时保持状态和所有借用存储。 在 start 前可以保存 "
"face；在成功 stop 后 face 的身份不变，provider 拒绝操作。"
msgstr ""
"Maintained assemblies use TOML schema 2. Schema-1 JSON reading is only for explicit migration and "
"tool-derived input, not a parallel authored copy of TOML configuration. Cold startup still "
"explicitly calls `nx_platform_start()` and shutdown calls `nx_platform_stop()`. BUSY/QUARANTINED "
"retain state and all borrowed storage. Faces may be retained before start. Successful stop "
"preserves face identity while the provider rejects operations."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/migration.md:32
msgid ""
"请求迁移必须同时更新所有权：prepare 不意味着 accepted，cancel 不意味着 settled。 接受后保持 request 与 payload，到 acquire-"
"observed SETTLED 才能复用。共享 owner 的控制 handle 持有稳定 slot+epoch；不能用一个旧 request 指针取消新 operation。 producer"
" 只提交与等待，唯一执行者持续 service；stop 先关 admission，再 drain 和 join，通知发布者退出前不能回收 notification。"
msgstr ""
"Request migration must update ownership too: prepare does not mean accepted, and cancel does not "
"mean settled. After acceptance, retain request and payload until acquire-observed SETTLED permits "
"reuse. Shared-owner control handles retain stable slot+epoch; an old request pointer cannot cancel"
" a new operation. Producers submit and wait; the sole executor continuously services requests. "
"Stop closes admission before drain/join, and notification storage cannot be reclaimed before "
"publishers exit."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/migration.md:38
msgid ""
"OS storage 使用真实每对象 stack/TCB/depth。任务 entry 返回不等于底层已删除： join 成功后才回收。超时保持 handle、stack 和 "
"TCB。持久化实例拥有外部 workspace； mutating I/O 失败后 reopen 确认 generation，不能凭错误结果推断 commit 未发生。"
msgstr ""
"OS storage uses real per-object stack/TCB/depth. Task-entry return does not mean underlying "
"deletion; storage is reclaimed only after successful join. Timeout retains handle, stack and TCB. "
"Persistent instances own external workspace. After mutating-I/O failure, reopen to confirm "
"generation; an error cannot prove that commit did not occur."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/migration.md:42
msgid ""
"迁移验收依次为：严格输入负路径、Native/model 行为、独立源码 SDK 消费、六基础 ARM ELF、精确预算、离线双构建与候选封存；最后按实际 PCB 和接线执行 HIL。 外部 "
"`nexus-examples` 是独立示例仓库，平台 CI 不把产品应用加入平台默认目标。"
msgstr ""
"Migration acceptance proceeds through strict-input negative paths, Native/model behavior, "
"independent source-SDK consumption, six base ARM ELFs, exact budgets, offline double-build and "
"candidate sealing; HIL follows on the actual PCB/wiring. External `nexus-examples` is an "
"independent example repository. Platform CI does not add product applications to default platform "
"targets."
